Heroes of Might and Magic III files for VCMI
============================================

VCMI needs the files of Heroes of Might and Magic III: The Shadow of Death,
or the Complete edition (GOG.com sells it; the CDs work too). They aren't
included. Restoration of Erathia on its own and the HD Edition are not
supported.

Put these directories from the installed game here (in H3data):

  Data   (H3bitmap.lod, H3sprite.lod, Heroes3.snd, VIDEO.VID, ...)
  Maps
  Mp3    (the music; optional)

Or keep them anywhere and *Set VCMI$Data to the directory that holds
Data, Maps and Mp3, e.g. in your !Boot:

  Set VCMI$Data ADFS::HardDisc4.$.Games.Heroes3

Getting them from the GOG installer, on RISC OS: !GOGImport (from the
same place as !VCMI, gogimport-*.zip) unpacks them here. Put the
installer's two parts (setup_heroes_..._(nnnnn).exe and its -1.bin) in
one directory, open the directory !VCMI is in so the Filer sees it,
run !GOGImport, drag the installer onto its icon and click Import.

Elsewhere: run the installer on Windows (or with Wine) and copy the three
directories from where it installed the game, or on Linux or macOS:

  innoextract -I Data -I Maps -I Mp3 setup_heroes_..._(nnnnn).exe

and copy the Data, Maps and Mp3 it makes.
